#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on
#. information from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:24
msgid ""
"Multilingual synthesizer add-on: auto-switches voices across eSpeak, "
"OneCore, SAPI5 & RHVoice based on text language."
msgstr ""
"إضافة مُركِّب متعدد اللغات: يبدّل الأصوات تلقائياً بين eSpeak وOneCore وSAPI5 "
"وRHVoice حسب لغة النص."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the
#. add-on store
#: buildVars.py:29
msgid "Improved language detection, speech segmentation, and number parsing."
msgstr "تحسين كشف اللغة وتقسيم الكلام وتحليل الأرقام."
